d Competition provides an ideal starting place for people who may not have a lot of experience in data science and machine learning.\"","topics":[],"score":219316,"global_rank":223095},{"name":"meghanmullally/third","owner":"meghanmullally","html_url":"https://github.com/meghanmullally/third","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219316,"global_rank":223102}]